35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The yard devices are a mess. The 2021 trial failed because of spreadsheets.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The invoices show separate licenses climbing yearly. Bundled ones stayed flat.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Last winter's outage was unowned for two days. Four suppliers, no clear lead.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,The warehouse rules were rewritten twice. The scope never survived a full year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,Two admins retire this year. The last hiring took eleven months. We are thin.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, if we pick modular, the costs will climb like the separate licenses.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, yes. A bundled subscription might be safer for the budget.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the scope creep is a problem. We need a fixed configuration process.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I agree. The dispatch tool skipped upgrades because testing took too long.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the peak season cutover is dangerous. We have no freeze window.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,We need something that works with our old scanners. No complex new hardware.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,I prefer the subscription model. It avoids the surprise maintenance costs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,A regional service team might be better than scattered suppliers.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,The dispatch tool is aging. We need a system that is easy to upgrade.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,The depot supervisors dropped the new routines. We need hands-on training.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
